
[l_english.FOCUS_C12_APPLELOOSA_UNION_NEGOTIATION]
Appleloosa Union Negotiation

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_APPLELOOSA_UNION_NEGOTIATION_desc]
The shadow of war once again loomed over the Apple Pie family.\nSince the Final War, the bond between the two families had been as solid as bedrock — their loyalty to each other proven through the howling trials of the Windigos. Now, the time had finally come for Maud Pie to sit down with Braeburn and properly discuss the concrete details of the long-awaited unification of their houses.\n\nAcross both Appleloosa and Rockville, ponies waited with bated breath. If the union could be achieved, the Apple family would lead the earth ponies into a brand-new era — and Harmony itself would be reborn.

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_APPLELOOSA_UNION_NEGOTIATION_TOOLTIP_1]
The relationship between the two families needs to be achieved §HIntegrated§!

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_APPLELOOSA_UNION_NEGOTIATION_TOOLTIP_2]
This will further enhance §R the friendship between the two families §! !

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_APPLELOOSA_UNION_NEGOTIATION]
与苹果鲁萨协商合并

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_APPLELOOSA_UNION_NEGOTIATION_desc]
战争的阴云再次笼罩在苹果派家族的上空。自终末之战以来，这两个家族的情谊坚如磐石，彼此的忠诚早已在风之魔呼啸的考验中得到了印证。如今，石灰派终于该与布雷本坐下来好好商谈两家真正合并的具体事宜了。无论在苹果鲁萨，还是在洛克维尔，小马们都在翘首以盼。

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_APPLELOOSA_UNION_NEGOTIATION_TOOLTIP_1]
需要俩个家族的关系达到§H互为一体§!

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_APPLELOOSA_UNION_NEGOTIATION_TOOLTIP_2]
这将进一步促进§R俩个家族的友谊§!
